                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "“I started arranging flowers as a break from a desk job. It was only meant to be for fun. Ten years later, it’s the job.”",
