                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "The afternoon started with a short breathing exercise and a playlist Lena made for the day. Each table had a vase, a pair of snips, some wire and a notebook for sketching.",
