                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "“It doesn’t have to be full. It doesn’t have to be symmetrical. It just has to feel right to you.”",
